    "needsReview": [
      "Default values are marked with ✦ (\"surface ✦\", \"2 ✦\", \"unchecked ✦\", \"default ✦\"). The component set default is `classic`.",
      "Color tokens read in size 2 with the sample text. In size 1 and 3 only measurements, gap and text style were read.",
      "Size 1 uses the size 2 text style (Typography/2/Regular) in Figma; in Checkbox and RadioGroup, size 1 uses Typography/1.",
      "Thumb position: left (unchecked) and right (checked) through track alignment with 1px padding; there is no travel variable.",
      "There is a border on the track even when on (neutral-alpha.7, surface and classic): it may be intentional or a leftover.",
      "In classic, the off track border is neutral-alpha.6 and the thumb has no shadow; in surface and soft the thumb has shadows.shadow-3.",
      "classic uses shadows.shadow-1 on the track, except in disabled.",
      "opacity on hover/active (0.88, 0.82, 0.92) is fixed in Figma, with no variable. It is the only case where the contract uses opacity; never for disabled.",
      "disabled looks the same for on and off: it does not distinguish the position by color. The text does not change color.",
      "The focus ring was read only in size 2 (radius 6 with radius.3-max). Corner radius in size 1 and 3 not read.",
      "The track is less than 24px tall in size 1 and 2: touch target below WCAG 2.5.8.",
      "No error state, required field or left-side label in Figma."
    ]
  }
